      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat a grill or broiler for high heat. Remove chicken from the marinade and thread onto skewers. Discard remaining marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill or broil chicken for 3 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
